// Bloody Bay

// HISTORY

// Swashbuckler
"PirateHistory1" "Two of the most fearsome pirates to ply these seas were Mary Reade and Anne Bonny.  So ferocious were these pirate queens that when their ship was captured in 1720, they were the only two to offer resistance. The two were captured and sentenced to death, but reprieved when it was learned they were pregnant."



// TOURISM

// Crooked Politician
"BloodyBay1" "Spanky Rabinowitz's cousin Charlie 'Big Buck' Rabinowitz owned Big Bucks Casino.  It is said much of Spanky's campaign money came from the take here."

// All Consuming
"BloodyBay2" "The Shiva Shard fed on the dead here, causing the trees to grow larger and stronger around the old graveyard."

// Imploding
"BloodyBay3" "In this building the first of Cape Canaveral's scientists was infected and transformed by the Shiva Shard, eventually causing him to implode."

// Ghoulish
"BloodyBay4" "The shards must be vibrating the very bones of the graves. You are almost sure you can hear scratching and clawing from the inside of the mausoleums."